Package: fastDR
Version: 1.1-0
Date: 2026-05-11
Title: Fast Doubly Robust Estimation
Authors@R: person(given = "Greg",
                  family = "Ridgeway",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "gridge@upenn.edu")
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0), gbm3, survey (>= 4.1)
Imports: methods
Description: Uses generalized boosted models to compute
   non-parametric propensity score estimates and a propensity score
   weighted outcome regression model to compute doubly robust estimates
   of treatment effects.
